msgid "Scenario III: Return to The Essex County Express"
msgstr "冒险III：重返疯狂列车"

msgid ""
"Remove Agenda 1a - \"A Tear in Reality,\" from the game and replace it with "
"the new Agenda 0a - \"Where There's Smoke\" and the new agenda 1a - \"A Tear"
" in Reality (v.II).\" (When you construct the agenda deck, agenda 0a should "
"be on top.)"
msgstr ""
"将密谋1a - “现实的裂口”移出游戏，并以新的密谋0a - “无火不生烟”和新的密谋1a - "
"“现实的裂口(版本二)”代替。(在构建密谋牌堆时，密谋0a应该在牌堆最上面)。"

msgid ""
"Put one of the four Engine Car locations into play at random. Remove the "
"other three versions of Engine Car from the game. Then, put six of the ten "
"Train Car locations into play at random, in a straight line to the left of "
"the Engine Car. Remove the remaining four Train Car locations from the game."
msgstr "在4张车头中，随机选择一张放置入场，将另外3张同名卡牌移出游戏。然后，将10张车厢卡混洗后，随机移除4张，剩余6张排成一直线放在车头左边。"

msgid ""
"Set the Engineer story asset and all 4 copies of Across Space and Time "
"aside, out of play."
msgstr "将机工师故事支援卡和4张跨越时空放在一边，位于场外。"
